{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":380,"mirrow":false,"y":-208,"img":"chara034_1","addImg":"chara034_1_face_chara034_1a"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":380,"mirrow":false,"y":-208,"img":"chara034_1","addImg":"chara034_1_face_chara034_1a"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"露帕","text":"[show]呼啊……我最近发现……躺在史莱姆身上也很舒服哦。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara034_1_face_chara034_1f"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"露帕","text":"[show]你还不知道吧，我也很会写评论哦。我曾经写过一篇……《从好到差，什么床垫躺着最舒服》投到大市集的报社去。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"露帕","text":"[show]最舒服的是羊毛做的，软绵绵的……躺下去一秒钟就要睡着了。[r]最垃圾的是魔爪蛇鳞，硬邦邦的……躺着感觉身子都要僵了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara034_1_face_chara034_1d"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"露帕","text":"[show]虽然这篇评论到最后也没能在报纸上发表……那些编辑真是有眼无珠，放着这么有研究价值的文章不让登报……还天天发甜点广告馋我。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara034_1_face_chara034_1e"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"露帕","text":"[show]你问为什么要搞这种排名？[r]因为研究怎样舒服地睡觉……是世界的终极课题之一啊……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}],"des":"露帕-友善1","script":"yd_034_01"}